<title>UKRAINE: Ukraine targets 90,000 tonnes '97 aluminium output.</title>
<headline>Ukraine targets 90,000 tonnes '97 aluminium output.</headline>
<dateline>KIEV 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ukraine plans to produce 90,000 tonnes of aluminium in 1997, Industry Minister Valery Mazur told a news conference on Monday.</p>
<p>He said Ukraine produced 80,900 tonnes of aluminium between January and November this year, down seven percent from the same period last year.</p>
<p>--Irene Marushko, Kiev Newsroom, +380 44 229 2264</p>
</text>
